 <61413159+Eliasny@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 03:09:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(server): ask access control before delivering an event

Part 3, 8.55 gives each node a ReceiveEvents permission: a session sees
the events of a node only when one of its Roles holds it. v1.5.10 sends
every event to every MonitoredItem that selects it, so a server cannot
keep the events of a Condition (live, and replayed by ConditionRefresh)
to the sessions allowed to see it.

Add UA_AccessControl.allowReceiveEvent, asked for each MonitoredItem
before the event is added to it, with the session, the SourceNode and
the event instance (the Condition for condition events). NULL keeps the
old behaviour.
---
 include/open62541/plugin/accesscontrol.h | 12 ++++++++++++
 src/server/ua_subscription_event.c       |  8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/include/open62541/plugin/accesscontrol.h b/include/open62541/plugin/accesscontrol.h
index 240f2bd..9d0cafd 100644
--- a/include/open62541/plugin/accesscontrol.h
+++ b/include/open62541/plugin/accesscontrol.h
@@ -143,6 +143,18 @@ struct UA_AccessControl {
                                                       UA_DateTime endTimestamp,
                                                       bool isDeleteModified);
 #endif
+
+#ifdef UA_ENABLE_SUBSCRIPTIONS_EVENTS
+    /* Allow the session to receive an event (the ReceiveEvents permission,
+     * Part 3, 8.55). Asked once for every MonitoredItem of the session that
+     * would report the event, also for the events of ConditionRefresh.
+     * eventInstance is the node the fields are read from (a Condition, for
+     * condition events) or NULL. NULL (the default) allows every event. */
+    UA_Boolean (*allowReceiveEvent)(UA_Server *server, UA_AccessControl *ac,
+                                    const UA_NodeId *sessionId, void *sessionContext,
+                                    const UA_NodeId *sourceNode,
+                                    const UA_NodeId *eventInstance);
+#endif
 };
 
 _UA_END_DECLS
diff --git a/src/server/ua_subscription_event.c b/src/server/ua_subscription_event.c
index 463de2b..9505a71 100644
--- a/src/server/ua_subscription_event.c
+++ b/src/server/ua_subscription_event.c
@@ -1715,6 +1715,14 @@ createEvent(UA_Server *server, const UA_EventDescription *ed,
                 continue;
             ctx.session = sub->session;
 
+            /* May this session receive the event? */
+            UA_AccessControl *ac = &server->config.accessControl;
+            if(ac->allowReceiveEvent &&
+               !ac->allowReceiveEvent(server, ac, &sub->session->sessionId,
+                                      sub->session->context, &ed->sourceNode,
+                                      ed->eventInstance))
+                continue;
+
             /* Evaluate the where-clause and create a notification */
             res = UA_MonitoredItem_addEvent(mon, &ctx);
             UA_FilterEvalContext_reset(&ctx);
